@startuml
title Stock-based delivery

box "Service Provider"
  participant "ProductOrderManagement" as POM
  participant "SupplyChainManagement" as SCM #blue
  participant "EventManagement" as Event
  participant "ProductOrderCapture\nValidation" as POCV
  participant "ProductInventory" as PI
end box
box "Logistic Partner"
  participant "P_SupChainMgmt" as PSCM #blue
end box
box "Delivery Partner"
  participant "D_SupChainMgmt" as DSCM #blue
end box

activate POM

== Stock-based Delivery with supply chain and delivery partners ==

group For stock-based product (Repeated for each Product requiring by a goods delivering)

    SCM -> SCM : 80 Determine Product configuration to be delivered

    note over SCM
      API Issue? Shipping order need to define shipement to pass Product Configuration.
      This is an issue as shipment as not yet been calculated.
      As of now stock Item is not managed in ShippingOrder
    end note

    SCM -> POM : 81 **TMF700 Shipping Order** POST /shippingOrder

    note left of POM : Ship «this» to «here» with this «shipping option»

    POM --> SCM : 82 **TMF700 Shipping Order** 201 Created\nShipping Order #26 created

    SCM -> SCM : 83 Define supply chain partner for Shipping to be delivered
    SCM -> SCM : 84 Regroup shipping order items in a shipment\nDetermine shipment by value
    SCM -> SCM : 85 **TMF700 Shipping Order** PATCH /shippingOrder/id26\n(to add shipment by value)

    SCM -> PSCM : 86 **TMF700 Shipping Order** POST /shippingOrder\nwith shipment
    activate PSCM

    note left of PSCM : Ship «these» from «here» to «here» with this «shipping option»

    PSCM --> SCM : 87 **TMF700 Shipping Order** 201 Created\nshippingOrder #LP1 created

    PSCM -> PSCM : 88 Pick&Pack
    PSCM -> PSCM : 89 Carrier Selection

    PSCM -> DSCM : 90 **TMF711 Shippment Management** POST /shipment
    activate DSCM
    DSCM --> PSCM : 91 **TMF711** 201 Created\nshipment.id provided
    deactivate DSCM

    PSCM -> PSCM : 92 **TMF700 Shipping Order** PATCH /shippingOrder/LP1\nto update ShippingOrderItem with shipment.id

    PSCM -> Event : 93 Event for shippingOrder/shippingOrderItem attribute value change\n(link shippingOrderItem to shipment)
    PSCM -> Event : 94 Event for shippingOrder/shippingOrderItem state value change
    deactivate PSCM

    Event -> SCM : 95 Notification for shippingOrder/shippingOrderItem attribute value change
    Event -> SCM : 96 Notification for shippingOrder state value change

    SCM -> SCM : 97 **TMF700 Shipping Order** PATCH /shippingOrder/id26\nwith Shipment.id for ShippingOrderItem\n+state change

    SCM -> Event : 98 Event for ShippingOrder attribute value change

    Event -> POM : 99 Notification for ShippingOrder/ShippingOrderItem state change
    Event -> POM : 100 Notification for ShippingOrder attribute value change

    POM --> PI : 101 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management** PATCH /product/id1\n(state update)
    POM --> POCV : 102 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH /productOrder/id1\n(state item update)

    note right of POCV : ProductOrder computes productOrder state accordingly to orderItem state

end

@enduml
